# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and adjust per environment.
#
# The SPA now talks only to the same-origin BFF; there are no OIDC/token settings in the
# browser. In dev, Vite proxies /api, /bff, /oauth2, /login and /logout to the BFF (see
# vite.config.ts). Override the BFF location only if it is not on localhost:8080.
#
# The BFF itself is configured server-side (nitrowater-bff/src/main/resources/application.yml).
